**Appendix**

* Clock maintenance checklist:
	+ Clean the clock face and mechanism regularly
	+ Lubricate the mechanism every 6 months
	+ Adjust the hands every month
	+ Check the power source every month
* Troubleshooting guide:
	+ If the clock is not keeping accurate time, check the power source and adjust the hands as necessary
	+ If the clock is not running smoothly, lubricate the mechanism
	+ If the clock is not displaying the correct time, check the battery and replace as necessary
	+ If the clock is not functioning at all, contact the station management for assistance. [End of bulletin] ... Show less
